  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal singleprofile models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 achieve moderate performance. This experiment tests changing the RNA encoder to scvi_n200 (a different representation) while keeping other settings identical (singleprofile, resnet50, aggregation=None, fusion=concat). This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder, a critical design choice, to determine if it significantly impacts performance. It balances exploration (testing a new encoder) with exploitation (using the same effective setup as top-performing models)."
}

